member.summary:
Get the text contained in an embedded resource in an assembly based of the type (uses the namespace of the type as a prefix).
Ex: Type namespace = "SysWeaver.Test" Compressed resource: "MyText.txt.br".
Use: var text = type.GetManifestResourceText("MyText.txt");

Create an object from the data contained in an embedded resource in an assembly based of the type (uses the namespace of the type as a prefix). The deserializer to use is based on the file extension.
Ex: Type namespace = "SysWeaver.Test" Compressed resource: "MyData.json.br".
Use: var data = type.GetManifestResourceObject<MyData>("MyData.json");
